   Command success means the PR was enqueued or auto-merge was enabled; it does not prove the PR has merged. After enqueue succeeds, wait for the merge queue to finish and then prove the PR actually merged. Do not use `gh pr checks --watch` as merge completion proof: PR checks can be green before GitHub creates or finishes the merge-queue run.
